        },
        {
          "name": "Apple Pay",
          "verification": "stub",
          "notes": "wired but unproven above Tier 2 — kit implementation + unit tests done 2026-08-01; device-verified needs a physical device (merchant ID + CSR/certificate, one CSR issues exactly one certificate). Device run not attempted; tier stays stub."
